    {
      "id": "WaveDeck執行期檔案都被git忽略",
      "kind": "unittest",
      "timeoutSeconds": 600,
      "reason": "wavedeck/.gitignore 補上實例鎖與 SQLite 檔（含 -wal／-shm）的忽略規則；新測試用 git check-ignore 逐一判定 WaveDeck 在 data/ 底下寫的檔案，並掃描 wavedeck/server 原始碼的 DATA / \"檔名\" 寫法，之後新增檔案忘了補規則會在這裡失敗；反向檢查被追蹤的 .gitkeep 沒被誤忽略",
      "targets": [
        "tests.test_wavedeck_gitignore"
      ],
      "changes": [
        "tests/test_wavedeck_gitignore.py",
        "wavedeck/.gitignore"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        ".gitignore",
        "tests/test_wavedeck_gitignore.py",
        "wavedeck/.gitignore",
        "wavedeck/data/.gitkeep",
        "wavedeck/data/exec_md/.gitkeep",
